# JKKN Bug Reporter (floating "report a bug" button for signed-in users)
# The key comes from the central bug reporter at
# https://jkkn-centralized-bug-reporter.vercel.app (organisation: jicate-solution),
# after an app entry for Event Form Management is registered there.
# Leave both empty and the button simply does not appear.
